	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12203"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=875" title="View the profile of Ldian">Ldian</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 10<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=875"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1209.msg12203#msg12203"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1209.msg12203#msg12203">Re: So this board sees a ton of action</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #32 on:</b> October 29, 2004, 10:41:55 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1209.msg12185#msg12185">Quote from: Zorlo on October 28, 2004, 10:20:10 pm</a></div><div class="quote">I realized that by writing about someone elses grammar usage, id be inviting someone to attack my own. In weak defense, mine dealt more with her using the wrong subjects, and glaring grammatical problems that confused the point of her arguments, not so much the individual words she mispelled. Given the casual nature of forum speech, i don&#039;t attempt to spell check every contraction i use. <br /><br />But please, i have absolutley no doubt that my vocabulary is larger then yours by a magnitude you can&#039;t possibly <br /><br />comprehend. I tried not to use any words that you would deem too &quot;complex&quot; or whatever you we&#039;re getting at in your post, but seriously, while you have the proof to back up your points on my grammar mistakes, you have little to no idea of how comprehensive my vocabulary is.<br /><br />Zorlo<br /></div><br />Apparently, correcting other peoples grammatical errors and spelling makes them feel like a big boy <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />.  &quot;Mommy WOW... I&#039;m a big kid NOW!!&quot;<br /><br />If you don’t have anything constructive to add to the conversation, then don&#039;t post.<br /><br />If your vocabulary is so much larger than ours, please enlighten us! I&#039;m sure we all would love to see this &quot;magnitude&quot; of knowledge. We can all dust off the ol&#039; dictionary and look up all of your BIG words.<br /><br />and just for fun champ!<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">mispelled </div> is spelled- misspelled.<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">someone elses</div> it would be someone <b>else&#039;s</b> <div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">absolutley</div> its spelled absolutely<br /><br />and last but the most important <div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> i </div> it&#039;s <b>I</b><br /><br /><br />So in short, do us all a fucking favor and eat a dick! <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: October 29, 2004, 10:45:31 am by Ldian</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12219"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=864" title="View the profile of Zorlo">Zorlo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 43<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=864"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Zorlo65@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1209.msg12219#msg12219"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1209.msg12219#msg12219">Re: So this board sees a ton of action</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #33 on:</b> October 29, 2004, 06:11:34 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							/gratz Ldian on your proofreading ability. I&#039;m sorry i dont spend more time living up to your standards, i&#039;ll be sure you try harder in the future.<br /><br />Also, just as a usage note, I said &quot;yours&quot; as in the second person singular, not as in your alls. I just said my vocabulary was larger then his not yours. <br /><br />Also Ldian, seriously, the whole &quot;gay&quot; jokes are awesome. Keep up the good work you bigot!
						</td>
					</tr>
