							Ya buddy, TFA&#039;s stubby would be so cool, and that would wrap up his hostile attempt to make this place his playground, short and infecting.<br /><br />I knew Angoir from before he was a ninja looting corpse defiler, he was a funny guy, but what usually happens, comedians change to suit their audience.&nbsp; They get more ghastly, more ghoulish, when they run out of funny things to say, they ridicule the holy fuck out of people.&nbsp; <br /><br />btw,<br /><br />I&#039;m not even mentioning Xxamots corpse again!<br /><br />[incoming excuse why what I said is lame puahaha]
